data: {"id": "4a8445db262040a9-thinking-parallel_evidence-2462", "run_id": "4a8445db262040a9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口（Pod: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl`）\n\n## 1) 实体身份与生命周期\n- **当前状态**：`CrashLoopBackOff`，已重启 13 次（最近一次 69s 前），运行时长仅 44m。\n- **Pod UID**：`5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`（kubelet 事件日志中可确认真实 CrashLoop 关联的 UID）。\n- **节点**：`node2 (10.2.0.50)`。\n\n**事实确认**：该 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，与上游层断言一致。\n\n## 2) 支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 的证据\n| 证据维度 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| **kubectl_events** | `Back-off restarting failed container app ... (5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26)`，177 次，持续 44m。 |\n| **", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789074908102, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

